  <description>
    <p>
      Arrow Escape is a challenging brain-training logic puzzle game
      where you plan your moves, follow arrow directions, and clear
      puzzle boards.
    </p>
    <p>
      Think ahead, find the correct sequence of moves, and solve
      increasingly challenging arrow puzzles.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Brain-training logic puzzles</li>
      <li>Arrow-based puzzle gameplay</li>
      <li>100 campaign levels</li>
      <li>Daily challenge</li>
      <li>Increasing difficulty</li>
      <li>Single-player gameplay</li>
      <li>Simple and intuitive controls</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.baniyamaniteja.ArrowEscape.desktop</launchable>

